---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1">Last updated: 2023-07-23</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose dark:prose-invert">
      <h2>Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>frhyme.code</strong>! At frhyme.code, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting any data you may share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your information when you visit our blog.
      </p>

      <h2>Data Collection</h2>
      <p>When you access our blog, we may collect certain non-personal information, such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>IP address, Browser type, Operating system</li>
        <li>Date and time of visit, Pages visited, Referring website</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        In addition, we use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> (a web analytics service provided by Google, Inc.) and <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to serve advertisements. These services use cookies and other tracking technologies to measure site traffic and personalize your ad experience.
      </p>

      <h2>Purpose of Data Collection</h2>
      <p>
        The collected information is used solely to analyze website traffic, understand user engagement, display relevant advertisements, and improve user experience.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact:
        <a href="mailto:freerhein@gmail.com">freerhein@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
